From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 18:27:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] docs(memory): reflect kernel+FTS5 consolidation; mark
 graphiti experimental

Updates help text and guides now that remember/recall are kernel-backed:
command descriptions and doctor detail drop the stale 'JSONL/file-backed'
wording for 'kernel store, FTS5-indexed'; TOOLCHAIN.md and the memory
backends guide describe the FTS5 recall path, the insights->recall link and
the one-time JSONL import, and mark the graphiti backend experimental until
its runtime emitter ships.

Issue: 9c8060f8-f4ec-47f4-b923-5e247c5bcdfd
